- name: crc
  id: digital_crc32_bb
  parameters:
    affinity: ''
    alias: ''
    check: 'True'
    comment: "Vuelve a calcular el CRC-32 de\ncada paquete: si coincide, lo\ndeja\
      \ pasar sin los 4 bytes del\nCRC; si no, lo descarta (ten\xEDa\nerrores).\n\
      Entra: bytes: paquete + CRC (N +\n  6).\nSale: bytes: paquetes correctos\n \
      \ [n\xFAmero | datos] (N + 2)."
    lengthtagname: '"packet_len"'
    maxoutbuf: '0'
    minoutbuf: '70000'
    packed: 'True'
  states:
    bus_sink: false
    bus_source: false
    bus_structure: null
    coordinate: [584, 3104.0]
    rotation: 0
    state: enabled
